(# Advocacy AI API Reference) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Version: 1.0 - Generated from the FastAPI route surface) Tj T*
(Base URL: https://www.advocacyalawfrim.in) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## Start here) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The complete interactive contract is exposed by **/docs** \(Swagger UI\), **/redoc** \(Redoc\), and) Tj T*
(**/openapi.json**. The branded reference is available at **/api-docs**. This document is the) Tj T*
(copy-friendly companion for implementation teams.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(> Public AI output is decision support, not legal advice. Agent-authored newsroom content is) Tj T*
(labeled agent-draft and requires qualified human review before reliance or publication. Never) Tj T*
(send secrets, passwords, private keys, or unnecessary personal legal facts in a request.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## Request conventions) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- JSON requests use Content-Type: application/json.) Tj T*
(- Protected routes use Authorization: Bearer <access_token>.) Tj T*
(- Use a stable session_id when continuing a chat.) Tj T*
(- Treat model, confidence, and agents_used as metadata-not a guarantee of correctness.) Tj T*
(- Use HTTPS only; keep tokens in server-side session storage in production.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## Authentication) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(### Register) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(POST /api/publication/auth/register) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Input:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(~~~json) Tj T*
({) Tj T*
(  "email": "operator@example.com",) Tj T*
(  "password": "at-least-10-characters",) Tj T*
(  "full_name": "Workspace operator") Tj T*
(}) Tj T*
(~~~) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Output:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(~~~json) Tj T*
({) Tj T*
(  "access_token": "<jwt>",) Tj T*
(  "token_type": "bearer",) Tj T*
(  "expires_in": 86400,) Tj T*
(  "user": {"id": "<uuid>", "email": "operator@example.com", "full_name": "Workspace operator",) Tj T*
("role": "member"}) Tj T*
(}) Tj T*
(~~~) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
