(  "total": 1,) Tj T*
(  "editorial_policy": "Agent drafts are informational and require human review before reliance.") Tj T*
(}) Tj T*
(~~~) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(POST /api/publication/articles is admin-only. It accepts title, summary, body, category,) Tj T*
(agent_name, and agent_category. Every write is stored as agent-draft and returns a human-review) Tj T*
(next step.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(### Compliance and governance) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(POST /compliance/dpdpa-check - Input {"document":"<policy or control) Tj T*
(text>","jurisdiction":"India"}; output is a structured check with findings and recommendations.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
