(## Deployment requirements) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Required runtime settings:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- DATABASE_URL - Neon PostgreSQL connection string, stored as a secret.) Tj T*
(- JWT_SECRET - high-entropy signing secret; no default in production.) Tj T*
(- ADMIN_SECRET - optional separate editorial publishing key.) Tj T*
(- ADMIN_EMAIL - optional first-admin email.) Tj T*
(- ALLOWED_ORIGINS - comma-separated browser origins; do not use * with credentials.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Python service must be deployed as the API origin. Cloudflare Pages alone serves static) Tj T*
(files and cannot execute this FastAPI application.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
